HELP|all|begin
SentAI ARM emulator module (B8)
Compiled namespaces: sentai.fs, sentai.rtos, sentai.fr, sentai.tpu, sentai.pipeline, sentai.crazy
This is an emulator bring-up subset, not the full production examples/sentai_runtime/modsentai.c module yet.
Useful commands:
  sentai.help('fs')
  sentai.fs.ls('/')
  sentai.fs.size('/path')
  sentai.rtos.ticks_ms()
HELP|all|ok
HELP|fs|begin
sentai.fs: FileX-backed emulator filesystem
  ls(path) -> list of (name, type, size)
  size(path) -> bytes or -1
  exists(path) -> bool
  read(path) -> bytes
  read_str(path) -> str
  write(path, bytes) -> bool
  append(path, bytes) -> bool
  mkdir(path) -> bool
  sync() -> bool
HELP|fs|ok
HELP|fr|begin
sentai.fr: FileX-backed flight-recorder subset
  init(), open(channel), close(channel)
  task_start(name), task_stop(name)
  push_event(label[, ts_ms])
  push_scalar(label, value[, ts_ms])
  stats(channel)
HELP|fr|ok
HELP|rtos|begin
sentai.rtos: minimal emulator timing helpers
  ticks_ms() -> FreeRTOS tick count in ms
  sleep_ms(ms) -> vTaskDelay wrapper
HELP|rtos|ok
HELP|tpu|begin
sentai.tpu / sentai.pipeline: B8 emulator TPU bridge surface
Guest-side calls are bridged to the host-side physical Coral path used by the emulator smoke and timing tests.
HELP|tpu|ok
HELP|pipeline|begin
sentai.tpu / sentai.pipeline: B8 emulator TPU bridge surface
Guest-side calls are bridged to the host-side physical Coral path used by the emulator smoke and timing tests.
HELP|pipeline|ok
HELP|crazy|begin
sentai.crazy: shared Crazyflie CPX/CRTP binding
  init([baud=576000]) -> int
  ping([timeout_ms=1000]) -> int
  canfly(), is_flying(), is_tumbled()
  battery(), altitude(), attitude_get(), velocity()
In the ARM emulator the UART transport is backed by the Renode CPX/UDP bridge to cf2.
HELP|crazy|ok
